        "wcagUrl": "https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/Understanding/keyboard",
        "impact": "Users navigating with keyboard or assistive technology cannot properly interact with nav > a:nth-of-type(1): Interactive element never received focus during the Tab crawl of 6 stops.",
        "evidence": "Interactive element never received focus during the Tab crawl of 6 stops.",
        "fix": {
          "patchType": "css",
